Implementation of ls(1)
=======================

Files:
- ls.c, ls.h: Main entry, argument parsing (getopt), directory traversal.
- print.c, print.h: Output formatting for regular and long format (-l).
- cmp.c, cmp.h: Comparison functions for sorting by name or mtime (-t, -r).
- Makefile: Build automation with strict C99 and warning flags.

Testing:
Outputs were tested against standard system /bin/ls using diff:
- ./ls > out1 && /bin/ls -1 > out2 && diff out1 out2
- ./ls -l > out1 && /bin/ls -l > out2 && diff out1 out2
- ./ls -la > out1 && /bin/ls -la > out2 && diff out1 out2
